---
const links = [
  { href: "mailto:salvadorcocosanchez@gmail.com", icon: "✉️", label: "Email", sub: "salvadorcocosanchez@gmail.com" },
  { href: "https://www.linkedin.com/in/salvador-sanchez-dev/", icon: "💼", label: "LinkedIn", sub: "linkedin.com/in/salvador-sanchez-dev", external: true },
  { href: "https://github.com/SalvadorCoco", icon: "🐙", label: "GitHub", sub: "github.com/SalvadorCoco", external: true },
];
---

<section class="section contact" id="contacto">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec__head fu">
      <div class="sec__eyebrow" data-i18n="ct_eyebrow">contacto</div>
      <div class="sec__title" data-i18n-html="ct_title">¿Hablamos sobre<br />tu proyecto?</div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact__wrap">
      <div>
        <p class="contact__intro" data-i18n="ct_intro">
          Trabajo con quien valora que las cosas funcionen bien. Si tu proyecto necesita una interfaz que cualquier persona use sin ayuda, escribíme.
        </p>
        <div class="contact__links fu d1">
          {links.map(({ href, icon, label, sub, external }) => (
            <a
              href={href}
              class="clink"
              {...(external ? { target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" } : {})}
            >
              <div class="clink__icon">{icon}</div>
              <div class="clink__text">
                <strong>{label}</strong>
                <span>{sub}</span>
              </div>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact__wsp fu d2">
        <div class="wsp-card">
          <div class="wsp-card__icon">💬</div>
          <div class="wsp-card__title" data-i18n="ct_wsp_title">Escribíme por WhatsApp</div>
          <p class="wsp-card__desc" data-i18n="ct_wsp_desc">Respondo rápido. Contáme sobre tu proyecto y te doy una mano.</p>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/5493584120469?text=Hola%20Salvador!%20Vi%20tu%20portfolio%20y%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20hablar%20sobre%20un%20proyecto."
            class="wsp-card__btn"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            id="wspBtn"
            data-wsp-es="https://wa.me/5493584120469?text=Hola%20Salvador!%20Vi%20tu%20portfolio%20y%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20hablar%20sobre%20un%20proyecto."
            data-wsp-en="https://wa.me/5493584120469?text=Hi%20Salvador!%20I%20saw%20your%20portfolio%20and%20I%27d%20like%20to%20talk%20about%20a%20project."
            data-i18n="ct_wsp_btn"
          >
            Abrir WhatsApp →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
